field has a too short input.\nThere was an unknown error uploading the file.\nYou are not allowed to upload files of this type.\nThe uploaded file is too large.\nThere was an error uploading the file.','Salon Contact Form','','publish','closed','closed','','contact-form-1','','','2026-06-28 07:58:34','2026-06-28 11:58:34','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&#038;p=11',0,'wpcf7_contact_form','',0),(12,0,'2026-06-28 11:48:25','2026-06-28 11:48:25','','Default Kit','','inherit','closed','closed','','10-revision-v1','','','2026-06-28 11:48:25','2026-06-28 11:48:25','',10,'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/?p=12',0,'revision','',0),(13,0,'2026-06-28 07:48:50','2026-06-28 11:48:50','<!-- Hero Section -->\n<div class=\"nh-hero\" style=\"background-image:url(\'/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/hero-salon.jpg\'); min-height:100vh;\">\n    <div class=\"nh-hero-content\">\n        <div class=\"nh-subtitle\">BEAUTY &amp; HAIR SALON</div>\n        <h1>Nelly Huanca</h1>\n        <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        <p>Where artistry meets elegance. Experience premium beauty services designed to enhance your natural radiance in a luxurious, welcoming atmosphere.</p>\n        <a href=\"/book-now\" class=\"button\" style=\"margin-right:15px;\">Book Appointment</a>\n        <a href=\"/services\" class=\"button btn-outline\">Our Services</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- About Preview -->\n<div class=\"nh-section\" style=\"padding:100px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;\">\n        <div>\n            <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/about-salon.jpg\" alt=\"About Nelly Huanca Salon\" style=\"width:100%; height:500px; object-fit:cover;\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <span class=\"nh-label\" style=\"display:block; font-family:\'Montserrat\',sans-serif; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c6a364; margin-bottom:12px;\">WELCOME TO OUR SALON</span>\n            <h2 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:2.5rem; margin-bottom:15px;\">A Sanctuary of Beauty &amp; Style</h2>\n            <div style=\"width:60px; height:1px; background:#c6a364; margin-bottom:25px;\"></div>\n            <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; line-height:1.9; margin-bottom:20px;\">At Nelly Huanca, we believe that every person deserves to feel confident and beautiful. Our team of skilled professionals combines expertise with creativity to deliver results that exceed expectations.</p>\n            <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; line-height:1.9; margin-bottom:30px;\">From transformative hair styling to rejuvenating skin treatments, we offer a comprehensive range of beauty services in an environment designed for your comfort and relaxation.</p>\n            <a href=\"/about\" class=\"button\">Learn More</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Services Preview -->\n<div class=\"nh-section nh-section-light\" style=\"padding:100px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">WHAT WE OFFER</span>\n            <h2>Our Services</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:30px;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-hair.jpg\" alt=\"Hair Styling\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Hair Styling</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $45</div>\n                    <p>Expert cuts, blowouts, and styling for every occasion. Our stylists create looks tailored to your unique personality.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-color.jpg\" alt=\"Hair Coloring\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Hair Coloring</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $85</div>\n                    <p>Balayage, highlights, full color, and more. We use premium products for vibrant, long-lasting results.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-skin.jpg\" alt=\"Skin Treatments\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Skin Treatments</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $60</div>\n                    <p>Facials, peels, and rejuvenation treatments that leave your skin glowing and refreshed.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:50px;\">\n            <a href=\"/services\" class=\"button\">View All Services</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Stats -->\n<div class=\"nh-section nh-section-dark\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-stats\" style=\"background:transparent;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>12+</h3>\n                <p>Years Experience</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>5,000+</h3>\n                <p>Happy Clients</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>25+</h3>\n                <p>Services Offered</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>15</h3>\n                <p>Expert Stylists</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Testimonials -->\n<div class=\"nh-testimonial\" style=\"padding:100px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">TESTIMONIALS</span>\n            <h2 style=\"color:#fff;\">What Our Clients Say</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap:40px; max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-testimonial-card\">\n                <blockquote>\"Nelly and her team are absolutely amazing. I\'ve never felt more confident after a visit. The attention to detail and personalized service is unmatched.\"</blockquote>\n                <div class=\"nh-author\">- Maria G.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-testimonial-card\">\n                <blockquote>\"I\'ve been coming here for three years and wouldn\'t go anywhere else. The atmosphere is so relaxing and the results are always stunning.\"</blockquote>\n                <div class=\"nh-author\">- Sofia R.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA Section -->\n<div class=\"nh-section\" style=\"padding:100px 20px; text-align:center; background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.85), rgba(0,0,0,0.85)), url(\'/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/testimonial-bg.jpg\') center/cover;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:700px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <span class=\"nh-label\" style=\"display:block; font-family:\'Montserrat\',sans-serif; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.3em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c6a364; margin-bottom:12px;\">READY FOR A TRANSFORMATION?</span>\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; color:#fff; font-size:2.8rem; margin-bottom:15px;\">Book Your Appointment Today</h2>\n        <div style=\"width:60px; height:1px; background:#c6a364; margin:20px auto 30px;\"></div>\n        <p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom:40px; font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.8;\">Let our expert team help you look and feel your absolute best. We can\'t wait to welcome you.</p>\n        <a href=\"/book-now\" class=\"button\" style=\"margin-right:15px;\">Book Now</a>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"button btn-outline\">Contact Us</a>\n    </div>\n</div>','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2026-06-28 07:56:16','2026-06-28 11:56:16','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/home/',0,'page','',0),(14,0,'2026-06-28 07:48:51','2026-06-28 11:48:51','<!-- Page Header -->\n<div class=\"nh-page-header\">\n    <span class=\"nh-breadcrumb\">HOME / SERVICES</span>\n    <h1>Our Services</h1>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Services Grid -->\n<div class=\"nh-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">TAILORED FOR YOU</span>\n            <h2>Beauty Services</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:30px;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-hair.jpg\" alt=\"Hair Styling\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Hair Styling</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $45</div>\n                    <p>Professional cuts, blowouts, updos, and special occasion styling. We listen to your vision and bring it to life with precision and creativity.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-color.jpg\" alt=\"Hair Coloring\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Hair Coloring</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $85</div>\n                    <p>Full color, highlights, balayage, ombre, and color correction. We use top-tier products for vibrant, healthy, long-lasting color.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-nails.jpg\" alt=\"Nail Care\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Nail Care</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $30</div>\n                    <p>Manicures, pedicures, gel nails, acrylics, and nail art. Pamper your hands and feet with our luxurious nail treatments.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-skin.jpg\" alt=\"Skin Treatments\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Skin Treatments</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $60</div>\n                    <p>Facials, chemical peels, microdermabrasion, and anti-aging treatments. Reveal your best skin with our customized skincare solutions.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-makeup.jpg\" alt=\"Makeup\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Makeup</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $55</div>\n                    <p>Natural looks, glamour makeup, bridal makeup, and special event styling. Our artists enhance your features with premium products.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-bridal.jpg\" alt=\"Bridal Package\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Bridal Packages</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $250</div>\n                    <p>Complete bridal beauty packages including hair, makeup, nails, and skin prep. Look flawless on your special day.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Pricing List -->\n<div class=\"nh-section nh-section-light\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">TRANSPARENT</span>\n            <h2>Price List</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:60px;\">\n            <div>\n                <h3 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:1.6rem; margin-bottom:25px; text-align:center;\">Hair Services</h3>\n                <div class=\"nh-pricing-list\">\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Women\'s Haircut</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$45 - $75</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Men\'s Haircut</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$30 - $45</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Blowout &amp; Style</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$40 - $60</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Full Color</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$85 - $150</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Highlights</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$95 - $180</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Balayage</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$150 - $250</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Keratin Treatment</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$200 - $350</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Deep Conditioning</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$35 - $55</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:1.6rem; margin-bottom:25px; text-align:center;\">Beauty Services</h3>\n                <div class=\"nh-pricing-list\">\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Classic Facial</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$60 - $90</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Anti-Aging Facial</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$85 - $120</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Classic Manicure</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$30 - $40</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Gel Manicure</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$40 - $55</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Classic Pedicure</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$45 - $60</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Makeup Application</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$55 - $85</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Bridal Makeup</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$120 - $200</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"nh-pricing-item\"><span class=\"nh-service-name\">Full Bridal Package</span><span class=\"nh-service-dots\"></span><span class=\"nh-service-price\">$250 - $500</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div class=\"nh-section nh-section-dark\" style=\"padding:80px 20px; text-align:center;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:600px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <h2 style=\"color:#fff; font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:2.5rem; margin-bottom:15px;\">Ready to Look Amazing?</h2>\n        <div style=\"width:60px; height:1px; background:#c6a364; margin:20px auto 30px;\"></div>\n        <p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom:40px;\">Book your appointment today and let our expert team work their magic.</p>\n        <a href=\"/book-now\" class=\"button\">Book Your Appointment</a>\n    </div>\n</div>','Services','','publish','closed','closed','','services','','','2026-06-28 07:56:49','2026-06-28 11:56:49','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/services/',0,'page','',0),(15,0,'2026-06-28 07:48:52','2026-06-28 11:48:52','<!-- Page Header -->\n<div class=\"nh-page-header\">\n    <span class=\"nh-breadcrumb\">HOME / BOOK NOW</span>\n    <h1>Book an Appointment</h1>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Booking Section -->\n<div class=\"nh-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">SCHEDULE YOUR VISIT</span>\n            <h2>Select Your Services</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n            <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; max-width:600px; margin:20px auto 0;\">Choose one or more services, pick your preferred date, time, and stylist. You\'ll receive an automatic email confirmation once your booking is confirmed.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Amelia Booking Shortcode -->\n        [ameliabooking]\n\n        <!-- Booking Info -->\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:40px; margin-top:60px; text-align:center;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-fade-in\" style=\"padding:30px;\">\n                <div style=\"font-size:2.5rem; color:#c6a364; margin-bottom:15px;\">&#128197;</div>\n                <h4 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:10px;\">Choose Date &amp; Time</h4>\n                <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; font-size:0.9rem;\">Select from available slots that work best for your schedule.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-fade-in\" style=\"padding:30px;\">\n                <div style=\"font-size:2.5rem; color:#c6a364; margin-bottom:15px;\">&#9989;</div>\n                <h4 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:10px;\">Select Services</h4>\n                <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; font-size:0.9rem;\">Pick multiple services for a single appointment. Mix and match as you wish.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-fade-in\" style=\"padding:30px;\">\n                <div style=\"font-size:2.5rem; color:#c6a364; margin-bottom:15px;\">&#128231;</div>\n                <h4 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:10px;\">Get Confirmation</h4>\n                <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; font-size:0.9rem;\">Receive an automatic email with all your booking details and reminders.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Note Section -->\n<div class=\"nh-section nh-section-light\" style=\"padding:60px 20px; text-align:center;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:700px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:15px;\">Cancellation Policy</h3>\n        <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; line-height:1.8;\">We understand plans change. Please give us at least 24 hours notice if you need to cancel or reschedule your appointment. Late cancellations may be subject to a fee. For questions about bookings, please <a href=\"/contact\" style=\"color:#c6a364;\">contact us</a> directly.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>','Book Now','','publish','closed','closed','','book-now','','','2026-06-28 07:57:12','2026-06-28 11:57:12','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/book-now/',0,'page','',0),(16,0,'2026-06-28 07:48:54','2026-06-28 11:48:54','','Shop','','publish','closed','closed','','shop','','','2026-06-28 08:04:41','2026-06-28 12:04:41','',0,'http://localhost:8080/wordpress/shop-2/',0,'page','',0),(17,0,'2026-06-28 07:48:55','2026-06-28 11:48:55','<!-- Page Header -->\n<div class=\"nh-page-header\">\n    <span class=\"nh-breadcrumb\">HOME / GALLERY</span>\n    <h1>Gallery &amp; Testimonials</h1>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Gallery Grid -->\n<div class=\"nh-section\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">OUR PORTFOLIO</span>\n            <h2>Recent Work</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nh-gallery\">\n            <div class=\"nh-gallery-item\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gallery-1.jpg\" alt=\"Salon Work 1\"></div>\n            <div class=\"nh-gallery-item\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gallery-2.jpg\" alt=\"Salon Work 2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"nh-gallery-item\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gallery-3.jpg\" alt=\"Salon Work 3\"></div>\n            <div class=\"nh-gallery-item\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gallery-4.jpg\" alt=\"Salon Work 4\"></div>\n            <div class=\"nh-gallery-item\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gallery-5.jpg\" alt=\"Salon Work 5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"nh-gallery-item\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gallery-6.jpg\" alt=\"Salon Work 6\"></div>\n            <div class=\"nh-gallery-item\"><img src=\"/wp-conten