r Services</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- About Preview -->\n<div class=\"nh-section\" style=\"padding:100px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;\">\n        <div>\n            <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/about-salon.jpg\" alt=\"About Nelly Huanca Salon\" style=\"width:100%; height:500px; object-fit:cover;\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <span class=\"nh-label\" style=\"display:block; font-family:\'Montserrat\',sans-serif; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.25em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#c6a364; margin-bottom:12px;\">WELCOME TO OUR SALON</span>\n            <h2 style=\"font-family:\'Cormorant Garamond\',serif; font-size:2.5rem; margin-bottom:15px;\">A Sanctuary of Beauty &amp; Style</h2>\n            <div style=\"width:60px; height:1px; background:#c6a364; margin-bottom:25px;\"></div>\n            <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; line-height:1.9; margin-bottom:20px;\">At Nelly Huanca, we believe that every person deserves to feel confident and beautiful. Our team of skilled professionals combines expertise with creativity to deliver results that exceed expectations.</p>\n            <p style=\"color:#8a8a8a; line-height:1.9; margin-bottom:30px;\">From transformative hair styling to rejuvenating skin treatments, we offer a comprehensive range of beauty services in an environment designed for your comfort and relaxation.</p>\n            <a href=\"/about\" class=\"button\">Learn More</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Services Preview -->\n<div class=\"nh-section nh-section-light\" style=\"padding:100px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">WHAT WE OFFER</span>\n            <h2>Our Services</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:30px;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-hair.jpg\" alt=\"Hair Styling\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Hair Styling</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $45</div>\n                    <p>Expert cuts, blowouts, and styling for every occasion. Our stylists create looks tailored to your unique personality.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-color.jpg\" alt=\"Hair Coloring\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Hair Coloring</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $85</div>\n                    <p>Balayage, highlights, full color, and more. We use premium products for vibrant, long-lasting results.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-service-card nh-fade-in\">\n                <img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/services-skin.jpg\" alt=\"Skin Treatments\">\n                <div class=\"nh-service-card-body\">\n                    <h3>Skin Treatments</h3>\n                    <div class=\"nh-price\">FROM $60</div>\n                    <p>Facials, peels, and rejuvenation treatments that leave your skin glowing and refreshed.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:50px;\">\n            <a href=\"/services\" class=\"button\">View All Services</a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Stats -->\n<div class=\"nh-section nh-section-dark\" style=\"padding:80px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-stats\" style=\"background:transparent;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>12+</h3>\n                <p>Years Experience</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>5,000+</h3>\n                <p>Happy Clients</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>25+</h3>\n                <p>Services Offered</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-stat-item nh-fade-in\">\n                <h3>15</h3>\n                <p>Expert Stylists</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Testimonials -->\n<div class=\"nh-testimonial\" style=\"padding:100px 20px;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <div class=\"nh-section-title\">\n            <span class=\"nh-label\">TESTIMONIALS</span>\n            <h2 style=\"color:#fff;\">What Our Clients Say</h2>\n            <div class=\"nh-divider\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap:40px; max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto;\">\n            <div class=\"nh-testimonial-card\">\n                <blockquote>\"Nelly and her team are absolutely amazing. I\'ve never felt more confident after a visit. The attention to detail and personalized service is unmatched.\"</blockquote>\n                <div class=\"nh-author\">- Maria G.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nh-testimonial-card\">\n                <blockquote>\"I\'ve been coming here for three years and wouldn\'t go anywhere else. The atmosphere is so relaxing and the results are always stunning.\"</blockquote>\n                <div class=\"nh-author\">- Sofia R.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- CTA Section -->\n<div class=\"nh-section\" style=\"padding:100px 20px; text-align:center; background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.85), rgba(0,0,0,0.85)), url(\'/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/testimonial-bg.jpg\') center/cover;\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:700px; margin:0 auto;\">\n        <span cla